        explanation: "CDCCL and Fuel Tank Safety instructions are embedded across Maintenance Programs, Airworthiness Directives (ADs), Service Bulletins (SBs), Aircraft Maintenance Manuals (AMMs), and Component Maintenance Manuals (CMMs)."
      },
